{"id":"13d81a43-7cbc-42f9-898b-d5930f30120b","rule_id":"b9554892-5e0e-424b-83a0-5aef95aa43bf","name":"【默认】Windows滥用组策略提升权限","immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"setup"}],"has_base_version":true},"version":215,"revision":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-15T06:09:02.981Z","updated_by":"elastic","created_at":"2026-09-15T02:32:15.429Z","created_by":"elastic","enabled":true,"interval":"5m","from":"now-6m","to":"now","description":"检测通过组策略增加特权的行为。对应需求：GPO策略创建/修改/删除。","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 身份安全","来源: 默认","对应需求: GPO"],"author":["Elastic"],"license":"Elastic License v2","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"id":"TA0004","name":"Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0004/"},"technique":[{"id":"T1484","name":"Domain or Tenant Policy Modification","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1484/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1484.001","name":"Group Policy Modification","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1484/001/"}]}]}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","winlog.computer_name","user.name","user.id","source.ip","event.code","winlog.event_id","event.action","event.outcome","winlog.event_data.TargetUserName","winlog.event_data.SubjectUserName","winlog.event_data.MemberName","message","event.original"]},"related_integrations":[{"package":"system","version":">=2.0.0"},{"package":"windows","version":">=3.0.0"}],"required_fields":[{"name":"event.code","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"host.os.type","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"winlog.event_data.AttributeLDAPDisplayName","type":"unknown","ecs":false},{"name":"winlog.event_data.AttributeValue","type":"unknown","ecs":false}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n需要 Windows/域控安全日志（Winlogbeat 或 Agent Windows 集成）。部分规则依赖活动目录相关事件。\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n请结合 Windows 安全事件字段：`user.name`、`source.ip`、`host.name`、`event.code`、`winlog.event_data.*`。\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权。\n2. 无授权则遏制账号并溯源。\n3. 关联同用户的登录失败、组变更、GPO 变更。\n","false_positives":["变更窗口内的合法管理操作","基线学习期的机器学习误报"],"references":["https://github.com/atc-project/atc-data/blob/master/docs/Logging_Policies/LP_0025_windows_audit_directory_service_changes.md","https://labs.withsecure.com/tools/sharpgpoabuse"],"risk_score":73,"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity":"high","severity_mapping":[],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","output_index":"","max_signals":100,"exceptions_list":[],"actions":[],"type":"eql","language":"eql","index":["logs-system.security*","logs-windows.forwarded*","winlogbeat-*"],"query":"any where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.code: \"5136\" and\n  winlog.event_data.AttributeLDAPDisplayName: \"gPCMachineExtensionNames\" and\n  winlog.event_data.AttributeValue: \"*827D319E-6EAC-11D2-A4EA-00C04F79F83A*\" and\n  winlog.event_data.AttributeValue: \"*803E14A0-B4FB-11D0-A0D0-00A0C90F574B*\"\n"}
